1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:08,760
In my stories, you'll see a link to sign the petition to reopen the case of Juliana and Zita,

2
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:17,000
a 16-year-old Black girl, Congolese immigrant, who was found hanged in Charlotte, North Carolina.

3
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:24,040
And not surprisingly, the police named it a suicide and closed the case.

4
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:32,460
The same way that we are rallying around Nolan Wells and that we have around other cases where Black lives have not mattered,

5
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:35,840
I'm asking you all to take the time out to sign that petition.

6
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:43,900
And I will speak more at length about the case on my radio show tomorrow on KBLA Talk 1580.

7
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:50,500
You can download the app. It goes live 12 to 2 p.m. Pacific, as well as 4 to 6 p.m. Pacific.

